    "_id": "bee-sting",
    "name": "Bee Sting",
    "instructions": "1. Add the Bärenjäger, Laphroaig, Fernet-Branca, egg white and tangerine juice into a shaker and vigorously dry-shake (without ice).\n2. Fill with ice and shake again until well-chilled.\n3. Double-strain into an Old Fashioned glass filled with fresh ice.\n4. Top with the bitters.",
